# Dataset Documentation

## 1. Dataset Information

**Dataset Name:** A Dataset of EEG Signals from Adults with ADHD and Healthy Controls: Resting State, Cognitive Function, and Sound Listening Paradigm

**Source:** Mendeley Data  
**DOI:** https://doi.org/10.17632/6k4g25fhzg.1  
**Dataset Link:** https://data.mendeley.com/datasets/6k4g25fhzg/1  
**Direct Download:** https://data.mendeley.com/public-api/zip/6k4g25fhzg/download/1  
**Published:** 3 April 2023  
**License:** CC BY 4.0  
**Institution:** Imam Reza University

## 2. Dataset Overview

This dataset contains EEG recordings collected from 79 adult participants:

| Class | Number of Subjects |
|---|---:|
| Healthy Controls (HC) | 42 |
| ADHD | 37 |
| **Total** | **79** |

- Age range: 20–68 years
- Gender distribution: 56 male and 23 female
- Sampling frequency: 256 Hz
- EEG channels: O1, F3, F4, Cz and Fz
- File format: MATLAB (.mat)

## 3. Recording Conditions

EEG signals were recorded under four different conditions:

1. Resting state with eyes open.
2. Resting state with eyes closed.
3. Cognitive challenge.
4. Sound listening (Omni harmonic).

## 4. Dataset File Structure

The downloaded dataset contains four MATLAB files:

| File Name | Description |
|---|---|
| FC.mat | Female Healthy Controls |
| MC.mat | Male Healthy Controls |
| FADHD.mat | Female ADHD |
| MADHD.mat | Male ADHD |

Each file contains 11 cells corresponding to different recording conditions and channel combinations.

## 5. Recording Details

| Cell | Recording Condition | EEG Channels | Duration |
|---|---|---|---|
| 1 | Eyes open baseline | Cz, F4 | 30 sec |
| 2 | Eyes closed | Cz, F4 | 20 sec |
